### Health Check / Root Endpoint
GET http://127.0.0.1:5000/

### Get All Todos
GET http://127.0.0.1:5000/api/todos/

### Create a New Todo
POST http://127.0.0.1:5000/api/todos/
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "title": "Complete Flask REST API",
    "completed": false
}

### Get Todo by ID
GET http://127.0.0.1:5000/api/todos/1

### Update Todo Status
PUT http://127.0.0.1:5000/api/todos/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "completed": true
}

### Delete Todo
DELETE http://127.0.0.1:5000/api/todos/1